{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Your mundane routine is over. Can you survive the nightmare?&quot;</strong> <br>What started as an ordinary night shift for a security guard turns into a horrifying ordeal. The once-familiar halls of the company are now twisted into a nightmarish labyrinth, filled with deadly threats and the eerie presence of unknown entities hunting you at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve to Survive</strong> <br>Each floor presents unique puzzles and challenges that stand between you and survival. The routine job you once knew is a distant memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Environments and Entities</strong> <br>Face a dynamic, ever-threatening environment and mysterious foes. They\u2019ll stop at nothing to end your journey. Your choices will decide your fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Experience</strong> <br>Uncover the secrets hidden in the shadows and attempt your escape under extreme pressure. The chilling atmosphere, enhanced by immersive sound design and visuals, will keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This Game Asks You:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Do you have the courage to face the truth in the endless darkness?&quot; <br>Survive. If you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Updates and Contact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or want to give me some feedbacks, feel free to email me on <a href=\"mailto:dudwlstldud@gmail.com!\">dudwlstldud@gmail.com!</a> I work alone, so I can't say that I can give you instant responses, but I'll do my best!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115520?t=1773382173","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/